d 'CONVERTANYTHING': module to multi-format importer and converter for Stata
d
d  Walks a file or a whole directory tree and converts every
d Stata-friendly format it finds (csv, xlsx, xls, and more) into
d .dta, mirroring the source tree, optionally importing every
d worksheet, cleaning variable names, and compressing. Turns a
d shared-drive drop of mixed formats into one clean set of datasets
d in a single pass. 
d
d KW: data management; file conversion; import; Excel; CSV
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260730
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Texas 2036
d Support: email eric.a.booth@@gmail.com
d
f convertanything.ado
f convertanything.sthlp
